  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kanaf 2 in Lebanon for the year 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing 21,735 purchasing vouchers and distributing them to 21,735 Syrian beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kanaf project in Lebanon for the year 2023 aims to shorten the suffering of many during the winter season, as children and their families will visit the shopping place and choose their winter clothing themselves.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winter clothing will be distributed to cover part of the response plan to the Lebanon crisis for the year 2022 - 2023 , as a number of 21,735 Syrian refugees will be targeted to benefit from the winter clothing for the year 2023 .</narrative>
  </description>
